The source PDF remains local and gitignored. If cleaner crops are needed, render
fresh crops from the PDF rather than committing full-page article images.

## Recommended Slide Treatment

Use `Stier2016_Fig5_herring_response_barplot.png` as the proof object and add a
short text rail:

1. Same herring system.
2. Same elicitation protocol.
3. Two distinct response models.
4. Governance has to reconcile knowledge systems, not just fit one biomass
   trajectory.

If the slide needs a visual "two mental models" cue, add a small secondary
thumbnail from `Stier2016_Fig2_cognitive_map_clusters.png`, but keep Figure 5
as the readable proof.
